      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LEVEL 3: mheap",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qddbzv7x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1052,
      "y": 1208,
      "width": 456,
      "height": 264,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 39472,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 53914,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Global heap, one big lock (or treap lock).\n\nContains:\n- free treap: free spans sorted by size\n- busy list: allocated spans\n- arenas: 64MB virtual memory regions\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\nmcentral runs out?\nLock mheap.lock\nFind N free 8KB pages in treap (best-fit)\nIf not found: mmap() from OS (64MB chunk)\nReturn mspan to mcentral\nUnlock\n\nSpeed: slowest but rarest.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Global heap, one big lock (or treap lock).\n\nContains:\n- free treap: free spans sorted by size\n- busy list: allocated spans\n- arenas: 64MB virtual memory regions\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\nmcentral runs out?\nLock mheap.lock\nFind N free 8KB pages in treap (best-fit)\nIf not found: mmap() from OS (64MB chunk)\nReturn mspan to mcentral\nUnlock\n\nSpeed: slowest but rarest.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
